    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so tiring. everyday feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless body through more time i didn't ask for. and when you say \"letting go\"... it makes me think that maybe the only way to actually get that relief you're talking about is to not exist at all. is that really the only way to make the noise stop?",
